{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y有些感受句的音乐意象解释得过满，且压缩掉了X中几处重要的心理转折和动机，例如没有急着用受过的委屈压住想念，以及最终不愿再为留住别人而吞下委屈。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词突出，叙述与感受交替出现，且部分感受随音乐节点出现，观众不必同时处理一大堆并列标签，更容易边听边抓住每段重点。它的音乐描述更具体，情绪有层次，反复出现的亲近、自己人、委屈和回头等意象也让整首曲子的情感线索更容易连起来。不过X在人物心理因果方面有优势，部分句子把犹豫背后的真实动机说得更完整，Y的压缩偶尔损失了这种细腻的心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d0b44d33-c004-4334-b007-62ee65dd29df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052323428739Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:24:13.407810+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f33201c35b61d3894317a9c4ed29120917a0cdabd51cdc0fafaf968a789c668c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha